            "review_title": "Review at Madison Food & Beverage",
            "review_text": "Georgia R\nTrowbridge, United Kingdom42 contributions\n1\nCheap and delicious\nNov 2019 • Couples\nFood and drinks were great and cheap. Staff did their own thing and didn’t pressure you to leave or buy more. There are only 1 or 2 tables to sit at, but this wasn’t an issue as we were the only ones there. \n\nVery underrated, I would definitely recommend.\nWritten November 14, 2019",
